{"id":54356,"date":"2026-07-22T08:27:13","date_gmt":"2026-07-22T07:27:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54356"},"modified":"2026-10-22T21:46:38","modified_gmt":"2026-10-22T20:46:38","slug":"vulcan-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vulcan-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Vulcan Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vulcan Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Vulcan Trail 2027<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>3 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), com partida e chegada no <strong>Campo de Futebol do Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Igreja Nova<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Mafra<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>). Esta prova de abertura do ano desportivo integra tr\u00eas vertentes em natureza: <strong>Trail Longo 20 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>), <strong>Trail Curto 12 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>) e <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:35<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos percorrem os trilhos rurais e forma\u00e7\u00f5es geol\u00f3gicas de origem vulc\u00e2nica que caracterizam a paisagem de <strong>Igreja Nova<\/strong> e os vales encaixados da regi\u00e3o saloia de <strong>Mafra<\/strong>, atravessando caminhos agr\u00edcolas, single-tracks e aldeias tradicionais. Com tempo limite global de <strong>4 horas<\/strong> e limite de 1000 participantes, o evento decorre em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia ambiental (sem copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos), promovendo o patrim\u00f3nio natural do oeste de Lisboa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova<\/strong>, o evento inclui dorsal com chip, medalha finisher, seguro e abastecimentos, disponibilizando como op\u00e7\u00f5es a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (+5,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026) e o tradicional almo\u00e7o quente com sopa, sandes de peru no espeto em <strong>p\u00e3o de Mafra<\/strong> e fatia de bolo-rei (+7,00 \u20ac). Planeia os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Campo de Futebol do Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova (Rua do Campo da Bola, Igreja Nova), Mafra, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\"