"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/09 a 02\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 21.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/11 a 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Curto 12 km (K12+)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 02\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/09 a 02\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 18.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/11 a 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 02\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/09 a 02\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/11 a 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rios de partida do Vulcan Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vulcan Trail realiza-se no domingo, dia 3 de janeiro de 2027, com partida e chegada no Campo de Futebol do Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova (Rua do Campo da Bola, Igreja Nova, Mafra). O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00, o Trail Longo 20 km parte \u00e0s 09:00 (controlo zero \u00e0s 08:45), o Trail Curto 12 km parte \u00e0s 09:30 (controlo zero \u00e0s 09:15) e a Caminhada parte \u00e0s 09:35.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Vulcan Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 3 fases (at\u00e9 ao limite de 1000 vagas): Fase 1 (at\u00e9 02\/09\/2026): 20 km por 17,00 \u20ac, 12 km por 14,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 12,00 \u20ac; Fase 2 (03\/09 a 02\/11\/2026): 20 km por 19,00 \u20ac, 12 km por 16,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 13,00 \u20ac; Fase 3 (03\/11 a 27\/12\/2026): 20 km por 21,00 \u20ac, 12 km por 18,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 14,00 \u20ac. Opcionalmente, \u00e9 poss\u00edvel adquirir t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (+5,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026) e almo\u00e7o quente (+7,00 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e que material devo levar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir a prova \u00e9 de 4 horas. N\u00e3o existe material obrigat\u00f3rio, mas como a prova decorre em semi-autossufici\u00eancia ambiental sem distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de copos nos abastecimentos, cada atleta deve transportar o seu pr\u00f3prio copo ou reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos, telem\u00f3vel e alfinetes ou porta-dorsal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios est\u00e3o previstos no Vulcan Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega de pr\u00e9mios realiza-se \u00e0s 12:00 junto \u00e0 meta, contemplando os 3 primeiros da Geral M\/F do Trail Longo (20 km) e Trail Curto (12 km), os vencedores dos escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Sub-23, Seniores, V40, V45, V50, V55, V60, V65 e V70+ M\/F) e as 3 equipas com maior n\u00famero de participantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Vulcan Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Vulcan Trail 2027 \u00e9 organizado pelo Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova (contacto oficial: vulcantrail.gdin@gmail.com), na freguesia de Igreja Nova, concelho de Mafra, distrito de Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Vulcan Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-03\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Campo de Futebol do Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova (Rua do Campo da Bola, Igreja Nova)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mafra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 5\u00ba Vulcan Trail 2027 realiza-se a 3 de janeiro em Igreja Nova, Mafra. Provas de Trail 20 km, 12 km e Caminhada. Consulta o regulamento, pre\u00e7os e inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-vulcan-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 20 km (K20+)\", \"price\": \"19.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/vulcan-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 12 km (K12+)\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/vulcan-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/vulcan-trail-2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rios de partida do Vulcan Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vulcan Trail realiza-se no domingo, dia 3 de janeiro de 2027, com partida e chegada no Campo de Futebol do Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova (Rua do Campo da Bola, Igreja Nova, Mafra). O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00, o Trail Longo 20 km parte \u00e0s 09:00 (controlo zero \u00e0s 08:45), o Trail Curto 12 km parte \u00e0s 09:30 (controlo zero \u00e0s 09:15) e a Caminhada parte \u00e0s 09:35.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Vulcan Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 3 fases (at\u00e9 ao limite de 1000 vagas): Fase 1 (at\u00e9 02\/09\/2026): 20 km por 17,00 \u20ac, 12 km por 14,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 12,00 \u20ac; Fase 2 (03\/09 a 02\/11\/2026): 20 km por 19,00 \u20ac, 12 km por 16,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 13,00 \u20ac; Fase 3 (03\/11 a 27\/12\/2026): 20 km por 21,00 \u20ac, 12 km por 18,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 14,00 \u20ac. Opcionalmente, \u00e9 poss\u00edvel adquirir t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (+5,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026) e almo\u00e7o quente (+7,00 \u20ac).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e que material devo levar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir a prova \u00e9 de 4 horas. N\u00e3o existe material obrigat\u00f3rio, mas como a prova decorre em semi-autossufici\u00eancia ambiental sem distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de copos nos abastecimentos, cada atleta deve transportar o seu pr\u00f3prio copo ou reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos, telem\u00f3vel e alfinetes ou porta-dorsal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios est\u00e3o previstos no Vulcan Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega de pr\u00e9mios realiza-se \u00e0s 12:00 junto \u00e0 meta, contemplando os 3 primeiros da Geral M\/F do Trail Longo (20 km) e Trail Curto (12 km), os vencedores dos escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Sub-23, Seniores, V40, V45, V50, V55, V60, V65 e V70+ M\/F) e as 3 equipas com maior n\u00famero de participantes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Vulcan Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Vulcan Trail 2027 \u00e9 organizado pelo Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova (contacto oficial: vulcantrail.gdin@gmail.com), na freguesia de Igreja Nova, concelho de Mafra, distrito de Lisboa.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70437,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-54356","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mafra-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-vulcan-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54356","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],